    "notes": "Closed score: split into 4 parts. Upper staff S (stems up) / A (stems down), lower staff T (up) / B (down), with independent rhythms: A quarter-note triplets against S quarters (bars 1, 3), A four eighths against S dotted quarter + eighth (bar 2), A ties against S dotted notes (bars 4, 7), A rests while S sings (bar 3 beat 1; bar 5 A half rest vs S quarter rest); T eighth-note triplets (bars 1, 3) and dotted rhythms against B; B whole-bar rest in bar 5 while T sings; T and B in unison on d at bar 8 beat 4 (one shared notehead, two notes). Quarter pickup, incomplete final bar of 3 beats; fermatas per voice at different onsets. Lyrics: Soprano verses 1 and 2 (between the staves, aligned to the soprano rhythm, melisma on \"hope\"/\"saints\"); Bass verse 1 (below the bass staff, aligned to the bass rhythm). Alto and Tenor have no lyrics in the score and in the truth.",
